<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 16:10:09 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>11 月 27 日最新石油市场新闻和分析</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-27</link><description>由于中东能源基础设施和油轮遭受袭击引发了人们对敌对行动升级的担忧，油价本月首次出现周度上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-27'&gt;11 月 27 日最新石油市场新闻和分析&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Latest Oil Market News and Analysis for Nov. 27&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-27</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 23:05:38 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>美联储面临的巨大压力</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-27/the-big-pressures-facing-the-fed</link><description>以及他们必须回答的难题。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-27/the-big-pressures-facing-the-fed'&gt;美联储面临的巨大压力&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：The Big Pressures Facing the Fed&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-27/the-big-pressures-facing-the-fed</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 15:53:26 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>人工智能工具重塑黑色星期五体验</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/ai-tools-reshape-the-black-friday-experience-video</link><description>随着假日购物季的到来，零售额预计将首次突破 1 万亿美元，购物者表示他们今年的支出将比去年更多。他们还有望让人工智能对他们购买的商品有更多的发言权。高力国际 (Colliers) 美国全国零售总监 Anjee Solanki 解释了第一个真正的“智能人工智能”假日季对购物者意味着什么。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/ai-tools-reshape-the-black-friday-experience-video'&gt;人工智能工具重塑黑色星期五体验&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：AI Tools Reshape the Black Friday Experience&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/ai-tools-reshape-the-black-friday-experience-video</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 15:54:40 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>假期过后风险偏好回升 美股将反弹</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/us-stocks-set-to-bounce-as-risk-appetite-returns-after-holiday</link><description>美国股市有望反弹，纳斯达克 100 指数跌至熊市边缘后，风险偏好有所回升。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/us-stocks-set-to-bounce-as-risk-appetite-returns-after-holiday'&gt;假期过后风险偏好回升 美股将反弹&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：US Stocks Rebound as Traders Pile Into Battered Tech Shares&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/us-stocks-set-to-bounce-as-risk-appetite-returns-after-holiday</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 07:56:20 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>亚洲股票期货信号上涨，油价再次上涨：市场结束</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap</link><description>周四，亚洲股市可能会在科技股上涨的基础上推动美国股指期货上涨，风险偏好复苏的迹象提振了包括铜和比特币在内的资产。也门胡塞武装袭击了沙特一家重要炼油厂后，油价上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap'&gt;亚洲股票期货信号上涨，油价再次上涨：市场结束&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Stocks Rise at End of Wild Week in AI-Trade Bounce: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 21:59:57 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>